# The operations of the pinned schema (openapi.v1.json) that this crate's own document (openapi.thrust.json) describes so far:
# `scripts/check-openapi.sh` cuts the pin to exactly these, diffs the two with oasdiff, and fails if the document has more or fewer.
# A resource is added when its bodies are types (issue #58); the end is the 32 operations of the scope `m1` (exceptions.yaml).
#
# Projects (8 of 8)
list_projects
create_project
list_projects_lite
retrieve_project
update_project
delete_project
archive_project
unarchive_project
